    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The Utility operating companies are transmission owning members of the Midcontinent Independent System Operator (MISO) RTO. MISO is the transmission provider under the MISO Attachment O. Entergy New Orleans incurred charges from MISO for the purchase of network transmission service under the MISO Attachment O. MISO calculated the network service charges applicable to Entergy New Orleans and billed the entity for such service.</link:footnote>
